# ─── GENERATED ASSETS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# zero_description/{urdf,mjcf,meshes} are all GENERATED (by scripts/gen_urdf.py and
# gen_scene.py) but are TRACKED on purpose: CMakeLists.txt does
#     install(DIRECTORY urdf mjcf meshes DESTINATION share/${PROJECT_NAME})
# so a missing directory is a hard CMake error and a fresh clone cannot colcon build at all.
# RViz also resolves package://zero_description/meshes/... at runtime.
# The cost is ~97 MB duplicated from robots/ (which is the source of truth and also tracked);
# the benefit is a repo that builds and runs straight from a clone. Worth it.

# Renders from gen_scene.py / shot2.py / camshot.py. Not needed to build or run, and they churn
# on every geometry tweak, which makes diffs useless.
scenes/*.png

# ─── COLCON / ROS 2 ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
build/
install/
log/

# ─── DATA: bags and datasets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Teleop bags carry 5 camera streams at 640x480 -- tens of GB per session. These belong on
# disk or the HF hub, never in git.
bags/
rosbag2_*/
*.mcap
*.db3
*.db3-shm
*.db3-wal
data/
datasets/
*.parquet

# ─── MODELS / TRAINING ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
outputs/
checkpoints/
wandb/
eval/
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.onnx

# ─── PYTHON ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ─── MUJOCO / TOOLING ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
MUJOCO_LOG.TXT
.mujoco_cache/

# ─── EDITOR / OS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
